#: ../../library/array.rst:74
msgid ""
"The ``'f'`` and ``'d'`` codes require firmware built with floating-point "
"support (the default on most boards). The exact width of ``'i'`` and ``'I'``"
" follows the host C ABI --- typically 4 bytes on the Cortex-M ports."
msgstr ""
"Kode ``'f'`` dan ``'d'`` memerlukan firmware yang dibangun dengan dukungan "
"floating-point (default pada sebagian besar board). Lebar tepat dari ``'i'``"
" dan ``'I'`` mengikuti ABI C host --- biasanya 4 byte pada port Cortex-M."

#: ../../library/array.rst:80
msgid "Classes"
msgstr "Kelas"

#: ../../library/array.rst:84
msgid ""
"Create array with elements of given type. Initial contents of the array are "
"given by *iterable*. If it is not provided, an empty array is created."
msgstr ""
"Buat array dengan elemen dari tipe yang diberikan. Isi awal array diberikan "
"oleh *iterable*\\ . Jika tidak disediakan, array kosong dibuat."

#: ../../library/array.rst:88
msgid ""
"In addition to the methods below, array objects also implement the buffer "
"protocol. This means the contents of the entire array can be accessed as raw"
" bytes via a :class:`memoryview` or other interfaces which use this "
"protocol."
msgstr ""
"Selain metode di bawah ini, objek array juga mengimplementasikan protokol "
"buffer. Ini berarti isi seluruh array dapat diakses sebagai byte mentah "
"melalui :class:`memoryview` atau antarmuka lain yang menggunakan protokol "
"ini."

#: ../../library/array.rst:94
msgid "Append new element *val* to the end of array, growing it."
msgstr "Tambahkan elemen baru *val* ke akhir array, memperbesar ukurannya."

#: ../../library/array.rst:98
msgid ""
"Append new elements as contained in *iterable* to the end of array, growing "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan elemen baru yang terdapat dalam *iterable* ke akhir array, "
"memperbesar ukurannya."

#: ../../library/array.rst:103
msgid ""
"Indexed read of the array, called as ``a[index]`` (where ``a`` is an "
"``array``). Returns a value if *index* is an ``int`` and an ``array`` if "
"*index* is a slice. Negative indices count from the end and "
":exc:`IndexError` is thrown if the index is out of range."
msgstr ""
"Bacaan berindeks dari array, dipanggil sebagai ``a[index]`` (di mana ``a`` "
"adalah ``array``\\ ). Mengembalikan nilai jika *index* adalah ``int`` dan "
"``array`` jika *index* adalah slice. Indeks negatif dihitung dari akhir dan "
":exc:`IndexError` dilempar jika indeks di luar jangkauan."

#: ../../library/array.rst:108
msgid ""
"**Note:** ``__getitem__`` cannot be called directly "
"(``a.__getitem__(index)`` fails) and is not present in ``__dict__``, however"
" ``a[index]`` does work."
msgstr ""
"**Catatan:** ``__getitem__`` tidak dapat dipanggil langsung (\\ "
"``a.__getitem__(index)`` gagal) dan tidak ada dalam ``__dict__``\\ , namun "
"``a[index]`` berfungsi."

#: ../../library/array.rst:113
msgid ""
"Indexed write into the array, called as ``a[index] = value`` (where ``a`` is"
" an ``array``). ``value`` is a single value if *index* is an ``int`` and an "
"``array`` if *index* is a slice. Negative indices count from the end and "
":exc:`IndexError` is thrown if the index is out of range."
msgstr ""
"Penulisan berindeks ke dalam array, dipanggil sebagai ``a[index] = value`` "
"(di mana ``a`` adalah ``array``\\ ). ``value`` adalah nilai tunggal jika "
"*index* adalah ``int`` dan ``array`` jika *index* adalah slice. Indeks "
"negatif dihitung dari akhir dan :exc:`IndexError` dilempar jika indeks di "
"luar jangkauan."

#: ../../library/array.rst:117
msgid ""
"**Note:** ``__setitem__`` cannot be called directly (``a.__setitem__(index, "
"value)`` fails) and is not present in ``__dict__``, however ``a[index] = "
"value`` does work."
msgstr ""
"**Catatan:** ``__setitem__`` tidak dapat dipanggil langsung (\\ "
"``a.__setitem__(index, value)`` gagal) dan tidak ada dalam ``__dict__``\\ , "
"namun ``a[index] = value`` berfungsi."

#: ../../library/array.rst:122
msgid ""
"Returns the number of items in the array, called as ``len(a)`` (where ``a`` "
"is an ``array``)."
msgstr ""
"Mengembalikan jumlah item dalam array, dipanggil sebagai ``len(a)`` (di mana"
" ``a`` adalah ``array``\\ )."

#: ../../library/array.rst:124
msgid ""
"**Note:** ``__len__`` cannot be called directly (``a.__len__()`` fails) and "
"the method is not present in ``__dict__``, however ``len(a)`` does work."
msgstr ""
"**Catatan:** ``__len__`` tidak dapat dipanggil langsung (\\ ``a.__len__()`` "
"gagal) dan metode ini tidak ada dalam ``__dict__``\\ , namun ``len(a)`` "
"berfungsi."

#: ../../library/array.rst:129
msgid ""
"Return a new ``array`` that is the concatenation of the array with *other*, "
"called as ``a + other`` (where ``a`` and *other* are both ``arrays``)."
msgstr ""
"Kembalikan ``array`` baru yang merupakan penggabungan array dengan *other*\\"
" , dipanggil sebagai ``a + other`` (di mana ``a`` dan *other* keduanya "
"adalah ``arrays``\\ )."

#: ../../library/array.rst:132
msgid ""
"**Note:** ``__add__`` cannot be called directly (``a.__add__(other)`` fails)"
" and is not present in ``__dict__``, however ``a + other`` does work."
msgstr ""
"**Catatan:** ``__add__`` tidak dapat dipanggil langsung (\\ "
"``a.__add__(other)`` gagal) dan tidak ada dalam ``__dict__``\\ , namun ``a +"
" other`` berfungsi."

#: ../../library/array.rst:137
msgid ""
"Concatenates the array with *other* in-place, called as ``a += other`` "
"(where ``a`` and *other* are both ``arrays``).  Equivalent to "
"``extend(other)``."
msgstr ""
"Menggabungkan array dengan *other* di tempat, dipanggil sebagai ``a += "
"other`` (di mana ``a`` dan *other* keduanya adalah ``arrays``\\ ). Setara "
"dengan ``extend(other)``\\ ."

#: ../../library/array.rst:140
msgid ""
"**Note:** ``__iadd__`` cannot be called directly (``a.__iadd__(other)`` "
"fails) and is not present in ``__dict__``, however ``a += other`` does work."
msgstr ""
"**Catatan:** ``__iadd__`` tidak dapat dipanggil langsung (\\ "
"``a.__iadd__(other)`` gagal) dan tidak ada dalam ``__dict__``\\ , namun ``a "
"+= other`` berfungsi."

#: ../../library/array.rst:145
msgid ""
"Returns the string representation of the array, called as ``str(a)`` or "
"``repr(a)`` (where ``a`` is an ``array``).  Returns the string "
"``\"array(<type>, [<elements>])\"``, where ``<type>`` is the type code "
"letter for the array and ``<elements>`` is a comma separated list of the "
"elements of the array."
msgstr ""
"Mengembalikan representasi string dari array, dipanggil sebagai ``str(a)`` "
"atau ``repr(a)`` (di mana ``a`` adalah ``array``\\ ). Mengembalikan string "
"``\"array(<type>, [<elements>])\"``\\ , di mana ``<type>`` adalah huruf kode"
" tipe untuk array dan ``<elements>`` adalah daftar elemen array yang "
"dipisahkan koma."

#: ../../library/array.rst:150
msgid ""
"**Note:** ``__repr__`` cannot be called directly (``a.__repr__()`` fails) "
"and is not present in ``__dict__``, however ``str(a)`` and ``repr(a)`` both "
"work."
msgstr ""
"**Catatan:** ``__repr__`` tidak dapat dipanggil langsung (\\ "
"``a.__repr__()`` gagal) dan tidak ada dalam ``__dict__``\\ , namun "
"``str(a)`` dan ``repr(a)`` keduanya berfungsi."
